## 🗄️ DATABASE SCHEMA

### MongoDB Collections Overview

#### 1. Users Collection
**Purpose**: Stores all user accounts (patients, doctors, admins)

**Key Fields**:
- `_id`: Unique identifier
- `name`: User's full name
- `email`: Unique email address
- `password`: Hashed password
- `role`: User type ('patient', 'doctor', 'admin')
- `profile`: Profile information
- `medicalInfo`: Medical history and conditions

**Relationships**:
- One-to-many with Appointments (as patient or doctor)
- One-to-many with Reports (as patient or doctor)
- One-to-many with SOAP Notes (as doctor)

#### 2. Appointments Collection
**Purpose**: Stores all appointment records

**Key Fields**:
```javascript
{
  patientId: ObjectId,             // Reference to User (patient)
  doctorId: ObjectId,              // Reference to User (doctor)
  date: String,                    // Appointment date
  time: String,                    // Appointment time
  reason: String,                  // Appointment reason
  status: String,                  // 'pending', 'approved', 'completed', 'cancelled'
  
  // Payment information
  paymentStatus: String,            // 'pending', 'paid', 'failed'
  paymentId: String,               // Payment transaction ID
  amount: Number,                  // Consultation fee
  
  // Meeting information
  meetingRoom: String,             // Virtual meeting room ID
  meetingStart: Date,              // Meeting start time
  meetingEnd: Date,                // Meeting end time
}
```

**Relationships**:
- Many-to-one with Users (patient and doctor)
- One-to-many with Reports (prescriptions)
- One-to-many with SOAP Notes

#### 3. Reports Collection (Prescriptions)
**Purpose**: Stores medical reports and prescriptions

**Key Fields**:
```javascript
{
  patientId: ObjectId,             // Reference to User (patient)
  doctorId: ObjectId,              // Reference to User (doctor)
  appointmentId: ObjectId,         // Reference to Appointment
  title: String,                   // Report title
  fileUrl: String,                  // File storage path
  
  // SOAP-like medical information
  subjective: String,              // Patient symptoms/description
  objective: String,               // Doctor's observations
  assessment: String,              // Diagnosis
  plan: String,                    // Treatment plan
  
  createdAt: Date                  // Upload timestamp
}
```

**Relationships**:
- Many-to-one with Users (patient and doctor)
- Many-to-one with Appointments

#### 4. SOAP Notes Collection
**Purpose**: Stores SOAP (Subjective, Objective, Assessment, Plan) notes

**Key Fields**:
```javascript
{
  appointmentId: ObjectId,         // Reference to Appointment
  patientId: ObjectId,             // Reference to User (patient)
  doctorId: ObjectId,              // Reference to User (doctor)
  
  // SOAP components
  subjective: String,              // Patient's reported symptoms
  objective: String,               // Doctor's clinical findings
  assessment: String,              // Medical diagnosis
  plan: String,                    // Treatment recommendations
  followUp: String,                // Follow-up instructions
  
  createdAt: Date                  // Note creation timestamp
}
```

**Relationships**:
- Many-to-one with Appointments
- Many-to-one with Users (patient and doctor)

#### 5. Doctor Schedules Collection
**Purpose**: Stores doctor availability schedules

**Key Fields**:
```javascript
{
  doctorId: ObjectId,              // Reference to User (doctor)
  
  // Weekly schedule
  monday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] },
  tuesday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] },
  wednesday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] },
  thursday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] },
  friday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] },
  saturday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] },
  sunday: { available: Boolean, slots: [String] }
}
```

**Relationships**:
- Many-to-one with Users (doctor)

