## 🌐 API ENDPOINTS

### Authentication Endpoints
```
POST /api/auth/register          # User registration
POST /api/auth/login             # User login
GET  /api/auth/me                # Get current user info
```

### Appointment Endpoints
```
GET    /api/appointments          # Get all appointments
POST   /api/appointments          # Create new appointment
GET    /api/appointments/:id      # Get specific appointment
PUT    /api/appointments/:id      # Update appointment
DELETE /api/appointments/:id      # Cancel appointment
GET    /api/appointments/patient-history/:patientId  # Get patient history
```

### Doctor Endpoints
```
GET  /api/doctors                 # Get all doctors
GET  /api/doctors/:id             # Get specific doctor
PUT  /api/doctors/profile         # Update doctor profile
GET  /api/doctor-schedule         # Get doctor schedule
POST /api/doctor-schedule         # Create/update schedule
```

### Report Endpoints
```
GET    /api/reports               # Get all reports
POST   /api/reports               # Upload new report
GET    /api/reports/:id           # Get specific report
DELETE /api/reports/:id           # Delete report
```

### SOAP Note Endpoints
```
GET  /api/soap/patient            # Get patient SOAP notes
POST /api/soap                    # Create SOAP note
GET  /api/soap/:appointmentId     # Get SOAP note for appointment
```

